[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
This package contains the sources of the upstream_check module and the
patch it needs for nginx itself.  It does not install a loadable module,
and this one cannot be made into one: the check state is wired into
nginx's own peer selection by patch, so the module is built into the
binary.

The module itself is built by the nginx ports.  To use it, build
www/nginx, www/nginx-devel or www/freenginx with the HTTP_UPSTREAM_CHECK
option enabled.  Those ports take the sources and the patch from
%%PREFIX%%/share/nginx/modules/nginx-module-upstream-check.
EOM
}
]
